  {
   "id": "text94_39399",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 76,
   "y": 1259.0,
   "width": 409.2,
   "height": 192.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1033108813,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1400113411,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1790175363079,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "id, hotelId, bookingId, roomTypeId, bedType\nnights: Night[]                 <- THE UNIT (D-15)\n  Night { date, roomId?, rate, posted }\n  arrive / depart derived \u00b7 a room move rewrites roomId\n  on unposted nights, never splits the Stay\nadults, children (< 6 free), guests: GuestId[]\nrouting? { categoryId -> own | master }   (group only)\nstatus: booked | checkedIn | checkedOut | cancelled | noShow\ncheckedInAt?, checkedOutAt?\n\nrules: check-in needs tonight's room, not OOO \u00b7 check-out\nneeds own folio 0 or transferred \u00b7 posted nights immutable \u00b7\nno-show only from booked after arrival \u00b7 cancel only if\nnot checked in, reason required, charges moved off first",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "id, hotelId, bookingId, roomTypeId, bedType\nnights: Night[]                 <- THE UNIT (D-15)\n  Night { date, roomId?, rate, posted }\n  arrive / depart derived \u00b7 a room move rewrites roomId\n  on unposted nights, never splits the Stay\nadults, children (< 6 free), guests: GuestId[]\nrouting? { categoryId -> own | master }   (group only)\nstatus: booked | checkedIn | checkedOut | cancelled | noShow\ncheckedInAt?, checkedOutAt?\n\nrules: check-in needs tonight's room, not OOO \u00b7 check-out\nneeds own folio 0 or transferred \u00b7 posted nights immutable \u00b7\nno-show only from booked after arrival \u00b7 cancel only if\nnot checked in, reason required, charges moved off first",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
