   "text": "capability  booking.create\nchecks      arrive < depart \u00b7 qty >= 1 \u00b7\n            availability per type (warn / override)\n            \u00b7 individual: room given + free\nemits       booking.created \u00b7 stay.created xN \u00b7\n            folio.opened (master if group, own per\n            stay)",
   "fontSize": 10.5,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
