   "text": "capability  -\nchecks      Billing and Expenses post entries;\n            Ledger enforces sum(lines) = 0,\n            immutability, close at 0\nemits       ledger.account_opened \u00b7 entry_posted \u00b7\n            entry_reversed \u00b7 account_closed",
