   "text": "v1     Setup \u00b7 individual + group booking w/ inline availability \u00b7 assign now or later \u00b7 tape chart + room map\n       check-in/out \u00b7 guests per stay \u00b7 one charge flow \u00b7 folio own/master + routing \u00b7 cash / transfer / card-method\n       payments, deposits, refunds \u00b7 receivables by company \u00b7 hk state + OOO \u00b7 dashboard + reports \u00b7 expenses\n       history tabs \u00b7 folio print \u00b7 search\n\nlater  OTA support (commission, gross/net, sync) \u00b7 discount approvals \u00b7 VAT / red invoice \u00b7 receivable due dates\n       group label + color \u00b7 registration card print \u00b7 PA18 export \u00b7 breakfast / pickup lists \u00b7 thank-you email\n       merge stay into group \u00b7 inspected hk state \u00b7 custom roles \u00b7 per-staff activity \u00b7 multi-currency\n\nnever  card data \u00b7 restaurant POS \u00b7 hk scheduling \u00b7 key cards \u00b7 hourly / day-use",
